      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "(2)  launch\n\nfork/exec + go-plugin handshake\nmagic cookie + ProtocolVersion\n(= ABI major; mismatch refused\nbefore any call)\nwrite pidfile, mint start-token",
