      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "At HEAD no first-party plugin ships (no plugins/ directory; OSCTF_PLUGINS_DIR defaults to ./plugins, absent = silent no-op).\nThe loader is exercised by 11 test doubles in internal/plugin/plugintest/doubles/. The four specced plugins \u2014 oidc, linear-decay, webhook, regex-flag \u2014 are M2/M3 work.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r_2088",
      "originalText": "At HEAD no first-party plugin ships (no plugins/ directory; OSCTF_PLUGINS_DIR defaults to ./plugins, absent = silent no-op).\nThe loader is exercised by 11 test doubles in internal/plugin/plugintest/doubles/. The four specced plugins \u2014 oidc, linear-decay, webhook, regex-flag \u2014 are M2/M3 work.",
